# Keep documentation line endings stable.
#
# The knowledge library is stored with LF. Without this, any tool that rewrites
# a file in text mode on Windows converts every LF to CRLF, which turns a small
# edit into a whole-file diff and hides the real change in review. That happened
# to docs/knowledge-library/index.md in commit 22ff3d5 (234 added / 234 deleted
# for a 20-line edit).
#
# Scoped to the library on purpose. A repo-wide `* text=auto eol=lf` would
# renormalise every source file in the tree, and `*.md` alone would rewrite the
# 8 markdown files still stored with CRLF (the storyboards and tools/README.md)
# as an unrelated side effect of an unrelated commit. Widen this deliberately,
# converting those files in their own change, not by accident.

docs/knowledge-library/*.md text eol=lf
docs/architecture/*.md text eol=lf
docs/ux-audit/*.md text eol=lf

# Keep diffs quiet for generated and vendored paths.
output/** binary
node_modules/** binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.mp4 binary
*.wav binary
*.blend binary
*.unity binary
